The bounded local proof includes author build and source gate, 53 author below-hash negative clones, canonical inventory verification (49 owned sources), canonical manifest verification (193 roles), 37 independent below-hash negative clones, and the local PS5 converter fixture. The converter fixture reports a positive exact 182-byte File-line test, seven diagnostic/path clone rejections, the sealed corrupt File witness rejection, four receipt schema negatives and alias-path rejection. Its reparse-ancestor negative was not tested. The case `runs/` directory was absent at review. No accepted parent checker, SSH preflight, or native command was run in this local proof.

Before SSH preflight, root must refresh active GUI/WTS ownership, mutex, competing-process and native-path absence checks and retain the actual SSH transport stdout/stderr/receipt and resulting preflight/PURE originals. A separate independent audit of those actual originals and a receipt-bound `GO_PRELAUNCH` are required before native dispatch. The one-cell XTIME, full 60-line physical-log equality, and 4,966-cell selected-report oracle remain prospective hypotheses.